# The API image is built from the repo root (see docs/api.md), so it can
# include data/. Everything is left out except what the API needs at runtime.
# Listing what goes in, rather than what stays out, means real driver data
# (data/real/), .env files and the front end can never end up in the image.
*

!api/requirements.txt
!api/app/
!data/*.json
!data/*.py

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
